# GEOtrack :

## Description of the application :

This application creates a world map for navigating between waypoints, activities and tracks. 

You can search using different criteria such as the type of activities, the name, the date...

The development is divided into two parts : The frontend and the backend.

## The Frontend :
The frontend provides the user interface and handles the visual and interactive aspects of the application using JavaScript and HTML.

## The Backend :
The backend handles the application's logic, functions, and algorithms.
